      "family": "L4 intestinal_absorption_permeability",
      "applicability": "moderate",
      "direction": "supportive",
      "decision_effect": "strengthened",
      "card_ids": ["C52","C53","C55","C56","C57","C59","C60","C61","C62"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct diltiazem-specific absolute oral bioavailability record is supplied.",
    "No modified-release formulation-matched F or matched oral-versus-IV exposure comparison for the query is available.",
    "L4 permeability/absorption records are for other molecules and do not quantify systemic F after first-pass metabolism.",
    "The query's ester hydrolysis and first-pass metabolic clearance are not directly measured in the supplied records.",
    "C54 (tamoxifen SNEDDS dissolution) and C58 (quetiapine solubility in Labrasol) are formulation-specific and have low direct transferability to the query."
